KAPP1
name=Kreative SDK
version=1
---
KreativeOS Shell SDK

Scripts are local text files, with one shell command per line. Empty lines and lines starting with # are ignored. Run a script with: run NAME

Example
# Inspect the system without changing it
net
uptime
ls
calc (8 + 4) * 2

Commands receive one argument string. Use help to list commands. The run command skips nested scripts and limits execution to 32 commands.

Desktop shortcuts
Ctrl+Space: search apps, files and browser history
Ctrl+1 through Ctrl+4: change workspace
Ctrl+T: switch browser tabs
Ctrl+D: toggle the current bookmark
